    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_1RB1LD_1RC1LA_0LD0RC_1LB1LC p j' E).
    + exact (geo_1RB1LD_1RC1LA_0LD0RC_1LB1LC p j' E).
    + lia.
