    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_1RB1RA_0LC1RD_1LA1LC_0LC0RD p j' E).
    + exact (geo_1RB1RA_0LC1RD_1LA1LC_0LC0RD p j' E).
